<title>USA: TABLE- Lehman Brothers Holdings sells notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Lehman Brothers Holdings sells notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc name was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>The deal was increased to $250 million from an original size of $150 million.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers is a major investment banking firm.</p>
<p>BORROWER LEHMAN BROTHERS HOLDINGS INC</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 7.20 PCT   MATURITY 8/15/2009</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.906  FIRST PAY DATE 2/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 7.212 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD +94 BPS    CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((Caryn Trokie, U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
